# ─── local SQLite database ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The DB holds every per-turn token count, session ID, project path, and
# message UUID parsed out of ~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl — i.e. your full
# private usage history. NEVER commit.
data/*.db
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db-wal

# Backfill stampede lockfile — mtime-based, regenerated on demand.
data/.backfill.lock

# PIDs that hung lsof (stuck remote mounts etc.) — GC'd against live PIDs.
data/.lsof_blocklist

# ─── python caches ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ─── personal scratch / local state ────────────────────────────────────
# next_steps.md is a personal nightly-generated TODO log — keep local.
next_steps.md

# Claude Code project-local settings (per-user allowlist / hooks).
.claude/

# ─── editor / OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── build / dist ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
dist/
*.egg

# ─── local pre-edit safety copies ──────────────────────────────────────
# Kept on disk deliberately (file-discipline: move, never delete), but they
# are byte-duplicates of shipped files. Committing them to a public repo
# publishes stale copies that someone later edits by mistake.
ubersicht/_antiquated_widget_copies/
